# S-31 — Customer account /v1/me (#21–#28, #30, #31, #33–#39). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): all as expected.
# every route: Cache-Control no-store; no token → 401; another customer's id/reference/number → 404
# #21 profile · #22 PATCH name/email/locale/marketing + pdplConsent → pdplConsentAt set; locale "fr" + bad e-mail → 400
# #24 first address → default (shortAddress upper-cased QBRA2929, mobile shown 05…) · #27 set default (the other loses it,
#   ux_address_default) · #25 update · #26 delete the default → the newest remaining becomes default · 11th → 400 (10 max)
#   bad mobile / empty city / short address / postal code → 400 · other customer PUT/DELETE/default → 404
# #28 enrolments (product, source, status, canLaunch) · #30 active → 409 enrolment.not_active; completed with certificate
#   T3C-2026-0200 → 302 {web}/ar/store/certificates/T3C-2026-0200 (dev DB, reset afterwards); other customer → 404
# #31 books: download grant (1 of 5) + delivered shipment with its print line
# #35 orders (summary: lineCount, hasInvoice, hasReceipt) · #36 detail · #37 INV-2026-000008 → application/pdf; another
#   customer → 404 document.not_found; lower-case number accepted
# #33 giving (0551110060): totals {given 700.00, unitsSponsored 2}, units {awaiting 0, allocated 1, completed 1}, group labels
#   · M6 donor: pooled {converted 0.00, remaining 0.00, seatPrice 450.00, shareOfSeat 0.22, sweptToFundAt}, dedication card
#   · 0551110601: donate line with latestUpdate and dedication
# #34 line detail: U-1 completed / U-2 allocated with region القصيم and group only, timeline incl. allocated → lapsed →
#   awaiting_allocation → allocated; donate line → the cause's updates; the JSON has no beneficiary code, name or mobile
# #38 export → attachment ta3lom-store-export.json {exportedAt, profile, addresses (10), orders (1), giving, enrolments,
#   downloadGrants, dedicationsSent}
# #39 DELETE {} → 400 (confirm) · {confirm:true} → 204, t3s_rt cleared; customer anonymised (+9665… placeholder, name/e-mail
#   null), addresses deleted, refresh tokens revoked, orders' contact + shipping recipient and the shipment recipient →
#   "محذوف / deleted" (city kept), purchased enrolment revoked + LmsRevoke; sign in again with 0551110050 → a new empty
#   account (no orders). The old access token keeps working until it expires (≤ 15 min, stateless JWT)
# integrity checks → 10 × 0 rows
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1/me
@token = <customer access token>

### #21 Profile
GET {{base}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #22 Update profile
PATCH {{base}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"نورة العتيبي","email":"noura@example.com","locale":"ar","marketingOptIn":true,"pdplConsent":true}

### #23 / #24 Addresses
POST {{base}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipientName":"نورة العتيبي","recipientMobile":"0551234567","city":"بريدة","district":"الريان","shortAddress":"QBRA2929","street":"طريق الملك عبدالعزيز","buildingNo":"8123","postalCode":"52361"}

### #27 Default
POST {{base}}/addresses/{{addressId}}/default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #28 Enrolments / #30 certificate
GET {{base}}/enrolments/{{enrolmentId}}/certificate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #31 Books
GET {{base}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #33 Giving / #34 line
GET {{base}}/giving/lines/{{orderLineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #35 Orders / #36 detail / #37 document
GET {{base}}/documents/INV-2026-000008
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #38 Export
GET {{base}}/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #39 Delete
DELETE {{base}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirm":true}
